{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：中国东方教育中期收入增10.6%，盈利修复节奏变化</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中国东方教育（0667.HK）交出一份不算差、但明显失去<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>感的中期成绩单。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在最新研报中给出一个核心判断：收入增长仍在，但利润修复已经从去年的高速状态回归常态，短期缺乏推动市场定价重新评估的明确<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">催化</span>剂。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。1H26收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24.18亿元</span>人民币，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.6%</span>，与1H25的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.2%</span>基本持平。表面平稳，结构却在变化：平均在读学生仅增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.4%</span>，而年化混合客单价上升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.0%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.97万</span>元，原因是集团继续向1-2年期高价值课程倾斜。调整后净利润增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20.5%</span>至5.01亿元，但调整后EBITDA只增6.0%，利润率反而下滑1.7个百分点至39.2%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">利润增速与EBITDA增速之间的缺口，是这份报告最值得拆开看的地方。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVCbIWE0y2ySibTt6H5sGJD8KVSV1sXZ1TEvcSvF9SOq4QzPQbCmuF8pBDueKAf6nugMZTLiaeH23aiaYSvuJrfibibT08e3uGMKpeU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 调整后净利润增速高于EBITDA，主因是税率与汇兑而非经营<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20.5%</span>的调整后净利润增长听起来不错，但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>明确指出，这个数字被两个非经营性因素抬高了：有效税率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24.7%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18.1%</span>，以及汇兑加回项。剔除这些，经营层面的真实盈利能力并没有同步<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把中间利润表摊开看更清楚。1H26毛利<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.09亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58.3%</span>，比去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">57.3%</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>1个百分点。但销售费用增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.8%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.68亿元</span>，超过收入增速5个百分点。行政费用控制得当，仅增5%，占收入比降至10.2%。最终经营利润率24.3%，略高于去年同期的23.9%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">简单说，毛利率在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，费用率在上升，经营利润率基本持平。利润的高增长主要靠税率帮忙，而不是经营杠杆。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看有效税率这个数字，从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24.7%</span>降到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18.1%</span>，直接贡献了相当一部分净利润增速。我的理解是，税率变化属于一次性或阶段性因素，不能当作持续经营能力的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>来外推；后续更值得观察的是，剔除税率影响后经营利润率能否真正抬升。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXlh5vjxAITPS8hIQYEibtecLhqMib4dycNFqRP6Ld7YI8iaKoZLKFRvhU5LJ1b1aWgdkKsEXic4MqsNNxpvwhPfAdbzEAY2pibSR1E/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 课程结构向1-2年期迁移，是盈利性换挡而非学生规模<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">课程结构的变化是这份报告最有信息量的部分。1-2年期新生注册增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.6%</span>至15,903人，平均在读学生增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58.9%</span>至28,030人，占集团平均在读学生的比例从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.5%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.7%</span>。但对比1H25，这两个指标的增速都从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">85.4%</span>明显回落。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">与此同时，2-3年期招生下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13.6%</span>，3年期招生下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.4%</span>。长期课程总招生仅增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.9%</span>，平均长期在读学生增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.9%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>的判断很明确：这是盈利性更好的组合切换，而不是学生基数<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">分业务看，增长引擎各不相同。汽车板块是价格驱动，收入增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.7%</span>，平均学生仅增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.4%</span>，客单价提升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.1%</span>，毛利率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>2.5个百分点。欧米奇和美容是人数驱动，欧米奇平均学生增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23.6%</span>但客单价降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.6%</span>，美容收入增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50.7%</span>但基数仍小。烹饪是稳定的利润基本盘，收入增7.1%，毛利率改善2.1个百分点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXwgicMdaZpW0sWNasrsl1BkJpwrsfP6jC7mt23YGt6zQKJu1PzSibL6QZtmAg2sHlmSt7icbO9xKssV5PaXkCqTILVQD8eicWk4a0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXSZHDbJCdckDl11nvgm8s8ibB6hREb4JqlksKQuHicSE9PSBYRx5zx9MbhxahvS2gwsAx0L05V1hfpQaA9SjR7ibar5Vma3GXB50/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 17-CITI-China East Education -0667.HK- Solid 1H26- but No Clear Earnings Upgrade Catalyst-260819</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
